        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Meri Beti\n- Companies: ARY Digital, ARY Group, Big Bang Entertainment\n- People: Badar Mehmood, Mohsin Ali, Fahad Mustafa, Ali Kazmi, Abdul Razzak Yaqoob\n- Topics: Pakistani drama serials, media companies\n\nFacts:\n- ARY Group is a Dubai-based holding company founded by Pakistani businessman Abdul Razzak Yaqoob.\n- Meri Beti is a Pakistani drama serial that aired on ARY Digital.\n- Meri Beti was directed by Badar Mehmood and written by Mohsin Ali.\n- Meri Beti was produced by Fahad Mustafa and Ali Kazmi under the banner of Big Bang Entertainment.",
